12: Bytes '\x0103000020E610000001000000050000000000000000000000000000000000444000000000000024400000000000004440000000000000244000000000000049400000000000000000000000000000494000000000000000000000000000004440'
13: BigUnsigned 100
14: BigUnsigned 10000
